flowchart TB
    accTitle: Where a copy goes that Paperless Sync deletes
    accDescr: A copy that Paperless Sync deletes in Nextcloud is gone for good when the app Deleted files of Nextcloud is off. Otherwise, the run moves it into the trash bin of the target user, who can restore it until the retention of the trash bin ends, whether the schedule, Synchronize now or occ started the run.

    deleted(["The app deletes<br>a copy"])
    trashbin{"Deleted files<br>of Nextcloud on?"}
    kept["🗑️ Trash bin of the<br>target user, to restore<br>until its retention ends"]
    gone["Gone for good"]

    deleted --> trashbin
    trashbin -- "no" --> gone
    trashbin -- "yes: a run of the schedule,<br>of Synchronize now or of occ" --> kept

    classDef check fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef kept fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef refused fill:#c9302c1f,stroke:#c9302c,stroke-width:2px
    class trashbin check
    class kept kept
    class gone refused
